# Journey to Windurst, part 2 in Windurst Woods at status 10 with the Kindred Crest in hand (the other half of
# Mourices's status 9 or 10 test). Mourices plays 467 (progress); its finish completes the mission, begins Journey
# Abroad, takes the Kindred Crest, moves to status 11 and gives the Kindred Report. The login in Windurst Woods also
# plays SoA's Rumors from the West zone-in 839, whose finish sets SoA status 4.
lists BalgasDais/onEventFinish/32001 HeavensTower/Kupipi/onTrigger HeavensTower/onEventFinish/242 HeavensTower/onEventFinish/246 WindurstWoods/Mourices/onTrigger WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/467
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=-50.6,-0.5,-27.6 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=0
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Sandoria JourneyToWindurst2 current
keyitem KindredCrest
login
missionstatus Sandoria 10
trigger Mourices
finish-if-event
finish
